        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "NVIDIA Sentry monitors AI agents and enforces access policies from a hardware-isolated trust domain on BlueField-4 DPUs, independent of host software.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/inside-nvidia-sentry-secure-ai-agents-at-runtime/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T09:52:16.000Z",
